## Problem solving process analysis

Number of pastries made = {pastries_made}  
Number of cakes made = {cakes_made}  
Difference = {pastries_made} - {cakes_made}  
The answer is {difference}.

## Actual analysis and solution process

In this question, {pastries_made} = 134 and {cakes_made} = 11.  
So the difference is 134 - 11 = 123.  
The answer is 123

## Problem solving process analysis

Total number of white t-shirts = {total_shirts}
Number of packages = {package_num}
Number of white t-shirts per package {shirts_per_package} = {total_shirts} ÷ {package_num}

## Actual analysis and solution process

In this question, {total_shirts} = 56 and {package_num} = 28.
Total white t-shirts is 56, number of packages is 28.
So the number of white t-shirts per package is 56 ÷ 28 = 2.
The answer is 2
